title: "Epigenetic Graph Analyzer (EGA)"
abstract: "Graph-based analysis of promoter capture Hi-C with chromatin states and gene expression: indirect contacts and promoter hubs evaluated against multi-way chromatin data, and gene-centred reports that offer candidate explanations of expression changes at the promoter, its direct contacts and its graph neighbours."
